---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About | Wisconsin Tech Solutions">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell" style="max-width: 780px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Custom AI for Midwest industries.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        We're a small, focused team of ML engineers and data specialists. We don't do off-the-shelf AI or generic
        consulting &mdash; we build proprietary systems that solve your specific technical challenges.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our practice is rooted in rigorous experimentation methodology. Every project starts with technical
        uncertainty and ends with measurable outcomes. We document every iteration, every hypothesis test, every
        decision &mdash; because the process of getting to production-quality AI is as valuable as the model itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're based in Wisconsin and partner primarily with Midwest manufacturers, healthcare systems, insurers, and
        financial services. We understand the industries you operate in, the compliance constraints you face, and
        the business outcomes that matter.
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>Full About page is being rebuilt. For now, reach us via <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
